  <p>Bumbum's guaran&aacute; <b>modelador</b> is like an at-home Brazilian lift &mdash; it firms a sagging bottom, softens the look of cellulite and stretch marks, and reaches the deep layer a $12,000 BBL fakes surgically. No needles. No downtime. Just 60 seconds a day.</p>
