  <h2>Helps To Firm, Lift &amp; Smooth</h2>
  <div class="probs">
    <div class="prob"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-guarana.webp" alt="Guaraná" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Cellulite &amp; dimpling</h3><p>Concentrated guaran&aacute; (caffeine) &mdash; one of the only cosmetic actives with published research for the <em>look</em> of cellulite &mdash; is massaged into the deep layer where the dimpling lives.</p></div></div>
    <div class="prob"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/skin-diagram.webp" alt="Skin layers" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Sagging &amp; loss of firmness</h3><p>Squats build muscle <b>under</b> the skin; lotions sit <b>on top</b>. The modelador works on the <b>middle</b> layer where firmness is actually lost &mdash; for a lifted, sculpted look.</p></div></div>
    <div class="prob"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-cupuacu.webp" alt="Cupuaçu" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Stretch marks &amp; crepey skin</h3><p>Cupua&ccedil;u butter deeply hydrates and helps soften the look of stretch marks and loose, crepey skin &mdash; including "Ozempic butt" after fast weight loss.</p></div></div>
    <div class="prob"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-acai.webp" alt="Açaí" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Dull, deflated skin</h3><p>Amazonian a&ccedil;a&iacute; &mdash; one of the densest antioxidant sources on earth &mdash; helps defend skin from the daily breakdown that leaves a bottom looking crepey and deflated.</p></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="statbox"><div class="big">~23%</div><p>less skin indentation in <b>8 weeks</b> &mdash; in a 2025 peer-reviewed clinical study of a topical <b>caffeine</b> cream-gel (the active concentrated in guaran&aacute;), measured with 3D skin imaging. Illustrates the ingredient class, not Bumbum itself. Individual results vary.</p></div>
  <figure><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ba-cli-2.webp" alt="Reader before and after" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><figcaption style="text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Real reader before &amp; after &middot; 6&ndash;12 week daily ritual &middot; individual results vary</figcaption></figure>

  <h2>Why Nothing Has Worked Before <span style="font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-size:19px">(It Wasn't Your Fault)</span></h2>
  <p>If you've spent hundreds on squats challenges, drugstore "firming" lotions, and $200 spa massages that did nothing &mdash; you need to hear this.</p>
  <p><b>It wasn't willpower, and it wasn't the fat.</b> Cellulite and sag live in the <b>connective tissue</b> under your skin. With age, hormones, and weight changes, the bands that hold everything taut weaken and let fat push up through the gaps &mdash; that's the dimpled, mattress look.</p>
  <p>Here's what no one tells you: <b>squats build the muscle underneath. Lotions sit on the surface. A BBL just adds fat on top of the same broken layer.</b> None of them reach the layer in the middle where firmness is actually lost.</p>
  <p>That's the whole job of the <b>guaran&aacute; modelador</b> &mdash; the concentrated caffeine ritual Brazilian women have used for 30+ years. The 60-second upward massage drives the actives <b>into that deep layer</b> instead of leaving them on top like a lotion. It does topically what a $12,000 BBL fakes surgically.</p>

  <h2>The Brazilian Actives Behind Every Result</h2>
  <div class="ing"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-guarana.webp" alt="Guaraná" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Guaran&aacute; Modelador (the hero)</h3><div class="st">~23% less indentation in 8 weeks &middot; cellulite score 3.96&rarr;2.50 in 12 weeks</div><p>Brazilian guaran&aacute;, concentrated for roughly twice the caffeine of coffee &mdash; the active studied for firmer-looking skin and less-visible cellulite. Two peer-reviewed trials (<i>Cosmetics</i> 2025; <i>Pharmaceutics</i> 2026, MDPI) back the ingredient class.</p></div></div>
  <div class="ing"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-cupuacu.webp" alt="Cupuaçu" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Cupua&ccedil;u Butter</h3><div class="st">Binds several times its weight in water</div><p>A Brazilian super-butter studied as an emollient that supports hydration, elasticity and barrier repair &mdash; softening the look of crepey, loose skin while the actives work below.</p></div></div>
  <div class="ing"><img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/ing-acai.webp" alt="Açaí" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><div><h3>Amazonian A&ccedil;a&iacute;</h3><div class="st">Inhibited collagenase ~36% &amp; elastase ~23% in ingredient research</div><p>One of the densest natural antioxidant sources on earth &mdash; it helps defend the enzymes that break down firm skin, thanks to its dense anthocyanins.</p></div></div>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">These studies evaluate the individual ingredients (the caffeine/guaran&aacute; class, cupua&ccedil;u, a&ccedil;a&iacute;), not this finished product. Individual results vary.</p>
  <a class="cta" href="#offer">Get 67% Off Now &rarr;</a>

  <h2>Loved By Thousands of Women</h2>
