  <h2>What Bumbum Does For Your Body</h2>
  <ul class="bul">
    <li><b>Firms and lifts a sagging bottom</b> &mdash; targeting the deep layer a BBL fakes, with no needles or downtime</li>
    <li><b>Softens the look of cellulite &amp; dimpling</b> on the buttocks and backs of the thighs</li>
