  <h2>How To Use &mdash; Just 60 Seconds</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><div><b>Apply</b> a small amount to your bottom and thighs after your shower.</div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><div><b>Massage</b> upward in circular motions for about 60 seconds until absorbed.</div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><div><b>That's it.</b> Once a day. No gym, no diet, no surgery required.</div></div>
  </div>
  <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/how-to-poster.webp" style="max-width:400px;margin:6px auto 0"><source src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/how-to-use.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>

  <h2>How Long Until I See A Difference?</h2>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="r"><span>Days 3&ndash;14</span><b>skin feels tighter &amp; smoother to the touch</b></div>
    <div class="r"><span>Weeks 3&ndash;6</span><b>dimpling looks visibly softer; jeans fit differently</b></div>
    <div class="r"><span>Weeks 6&ndash;12</span><b>the firmer, lifted look holds &mdash; the full window</b></div>
  </div>
  <p>The curve only bends upward around week 6 &mdash; which is exactly why most women order <b>2&ndash;3 jars</b> and finish the full cycle instead of stopping right as their skin starts to turn.</p>

  <div class="gtee">
    <img src="https://bumbum-cream-lp.vercel.app/img/guarantee-seal.webp" alt="60-day money-back guarantee" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
    <div class="t">Firmer In 60 Days &mdash; Or Pay Nothing.</div>
    <p style="margin:0">Try Bumbum for a full 60 days. If your bottom isn't visibly firmer &mdash; for any reason &mdash; email us and get every penny back, even on an opened jar. Most women never send it back. The only real risk is doing nothing.</p>
