  <p>You won't find Bumbum on a shelf next to the $120 designer jars &mdash; it ships direct from the brand, which is how a real guaran&aacute; modelador drops to as little as <b>$13.33 a jar</b>. For context: a BBL runs $8,000&ndash;$15,000 with weeks of recovery.</p>
