    <p class="reassure">&#128274; Secure checkout &middot; &#128666; Free US shipping &middot; &#9989; 60-day money-back guarantee &mdash; keep the jar</p>
  </div>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#444">Because it's small-batch and blended in the USA, Bumbum does sell out. If it's in stock when you check, we wouldn't wait &mdash; restocks can take weeks.</p>

  <h2>Your Questions, Answered</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <details><summary>How is Bumbum different from creams I've tried?</summary><p>Most "firming" lotions are watered-down moisturizer that sits on the surface. Bumbum is the concentrated guaran&aacute; <b>modelador</b> class, and the 60-second upward massage drives the actives into the deep layer where firmness is actually lost &mdash; not off the top.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How long before I see results?</summary><p>Most women feel tighter, smoother skin within 7&ndash;14 days. Visible softening of dimpling usually shows around weeks 3&ndash;6, and the full window is 60&ndash;90 days of daily use.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How long does one jar last?</summary><p>About 4 weeks with daily use on the bottom and thighs. Most women choose the 2 or 3-jar kit to finish the full 60&ndash;90 day cycle without running out mid-transformation.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is it safe for sensitive skin?</summary><p>It's a topical cosmetic &mdash; guaran&aacute;, cupua&ccedil;u butter and a&ccedil;a&iacute;, cruelty-free and dermatologist-tested. Most report only a light guaran&aacute; warmth. Patch-test first if your skin is sensitive, and discontinue if irritation occurs.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I use it on thighs, tummy and arms?</summary><p>Yes. Women use the same 60-second ritual anywhere skin looks soft, dimpled or crepey &mdash; thighs, tummy, upper arms. Same cream, same technique.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><p>You pay nothing. Every order is covered by a 60-day money-back guarantee &mdash; even on an opened jar. Email us and get a complete refund. No questions.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How long will the discount last?</summary><p>The current discount is available while supplies last. Bumbum is small-batch and blended in the USA; when this batch sells out, restocking takes weeks, and the discount may not return.</p></details>
  </div>

